    {
      "id": "github:1324163874",
      "name": "OpenBooks",
      "track": "open_source",
      "summary": "通用、自托管的开源 business suite；非营利基金会计是同一 AGPL 仓库内通过 Company Settings → Features 开启的可选功能组，不是独立 SKU 或单独付费版。保留的官方源码与集成测试显示：基金按 operating/restricted/endowment/plant/board_designated 分类并作为平衡维度，分录按 fund 维度入账，跨基金分录用已配置的 due-from/due-to 生成平衡腿，限制解除会校验类别对与可用余额后过账，功能费用固定为 program/management_general/fundraising，并输出可按基金过滤的非营利报表。README 标为 alpha、未完成独立会计/安全认证，能力清单与测试不代表可直接投产；许可证 README 标 AGPL-3.0-or-later，GitHub license API 返回 AGPL-3.0。homepage 取自仓库元数据。",
      "homepage": "https://openbooks-site.vercel.app",
      "repository_url": "https://github.com/braedonsaunders/openbooks",
      "github_repository_id": 1324163874,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/braedonsaunders/openbooks/license",
      "features": [
        "基金维度：FundKind 为 operating/restricted/endowment/plant/board_designated；createFund 要求 fund 段存在且 is_balancing，并记录 restriction_class 与 off/advisory/hard 预算控制（funds.ts:7,73-102,205-208）",
        "逐笔基金入账与基金平衡：分录行使用 extra_dims.fund；非零残差无基金时以 fund_missing 拒绝，缺省时回填默认基金，按基金汇总后生成平衡腿，集成测试断言每基金合计为零（fund-posting.ts:122-155；fund-balancing.integration.test.ts:99-104,252-264）",
        "基金间配对：setFundPair 配置基金间 due-from/due-to 账户，interfundLegs 生成带基金维度的平衡腿；未配置配对时以 interfund_pair_missing 拒绝（funds.ts:236-259；fund-posting.ts:236-285；fund-balancing.integration.test.ts:106-196）",
        "限制解除：fund_releases 状态含 draft/pending_approval/posted/void；过账校验限制类别对、可用余额、期间与留本董事会拨款，成功后写 posted_entry_id（releases.ts:33,207-320,783-855）",
        "功能费用：固定 program/management_general/fundraising 三类映射；费用缺少有效映射时拒绝出表（functional.ts:16-17,384-414）",
        "基金级/非营利报表：loadNonprofitStatements 支持 fundId 过滤，输出按限制类净资产、活动、功能费用与现金流调节，并提供基金覆盖 tie-out（statements.ts:70-159,500-549,743-781）",
        "可选功能边界：nonprofit/fundAccounting/functionalExpenses 等由 Company Settings → Features 开关；关闭后拒绝相关记账并隐藏内置报表（README:190,208；feature-fence.integration.test.ts:42-53,390-434）",
        "README 明确 alpha、未完成独立会计或安全认证，能力为代码现状而非可直接投产承诺（README:136,190）"
      ],
      "deployment": [
        "Docker Compose 自托管 Web 应用",
        "PostgreSQL 16、Redis 7、MinIO 与独立后台 worker"
      ],
      "technology_stack": [
        "TypeScript",
        "Next.js",
        "PostgreSQL 16",
        "Redis 7",
        "Docker Compose"
      ],
